# Files in this repository that are NOT part of the website.
#
# Everything at the root is uploaded and served by address, so without
# this list the worker's own source, the database scripts and the setup
# notes would all be downloadable from the site. None of them hold a
# secret - the only keys in this repository are the publishable ones -
# but they are not pages, so they should not be served as pages.

worker.js
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore

# database scripts, run by hand in Supabase
*.sql
supabase/

# notes for whoever maintains this
README.md
SETUP.md

# working files
.agents/
.claude/
skills-lock.json

# the untouched camera files behind the gallery. Kept in the repository
# so a picture can be redone at a different size later; 31 MB of HEIC
# nobody's browser can display is not something to serve.
images/gallery/originals/

# git's own storage. The assets directory is the repository root, so
# without this line the walker sweeps .git/ into the site: every build
# broke the day the photographs pushed git's pack file past Cloudflare's
# 25 MiB per-file limit, and before that the repository's entire history
# was being served as public files at /.git/. Neither is a thing a
# website should do.
/.git/
/.wrangler/
.DS_Store
# the camera original behind the launch slide; the page serves the webp
images/apps/Pulse Room Carasol Background.jpg
